    "reading": {
        "body": "Cryptography hiring in this sample is concentrated in a handful of employers, with IonQ and ServiceNow accounting for six of eight postings.\n\nThe pattern is narrow rather than broad. Five of the eight roles sit at IonQ in Geneva, all posted on the same day, and three sit at ServiceNow across San Diego and Santa Clara. Cloudflare contributes one. The functions are uniform: every posting is tagged Cryptography under the security category, spanning senior through distinguished and staff levels. This is a cluster of senior and principal openings, not entry-level demand.\n\nFor AI specifically, the data supports only a limited claim. Cryptography underpins secure inference, model weights, and API traffic, and Cloudflare's PKI role touches the infrastructure layer that AI services run behind. But nothing here names AI workloads, GPUs, data centers, or power, so the connection to compute scaling is inferred from the employers, not stated in the postings. IonQ is a quantum computing company, and post-quantum cryptography work is a distinct driver from AI demand.\n\nWhat this does not tell the reader: eight postings is a small sample, and the source list includes aggregators whose coverage of this niche may be partial. The dates cluster in late September and early October 2026, so this is a snapshot, not a trend. It cannot show whether cryptography hiring is rising or falling, only that these specific roles were open on these days.",
